{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:08 2026-11-02 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:08 2026-11-02 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:08 2026-11-02 HKT</p><img alt=\"佐敦私家車溶溶爛爛惹疑 警截車搜查 起出毒品拘司機\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/6a0f524f46b10a24ea8ba7a5edbbd3d9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_20_07_25_1__0.jpeg\"/><p>佐敦道與彌敦道交界，今日（11月2日）晚上7時許，西九龍總區衝鋒隊人員巡邏時，發現一部車頭損毀的可疑私家車，遂上前截查。其後，警方在車內發現一批毒品和現金，懷疑車輛是毒品快餐車，遂將私家車司機拘捕。</p><p>現場所見，涉案銀色私家車車頭有多處刮痕，車頭蓋無法關實，要用膠紙貼穩。至於被捕司機黑布蒙頭，被帶上警車調查。據悉涉案毒品包括可卡因及依托咪酯煙彈，數量及市值有待點算。案件仍在調查。</p><img alt=\"現場為佐敦道與彌敦道交界。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7584f3e37491b4047b7715f3596322a5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_20_07_23.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"涉案私家車車頭有多處刮痕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/83efcabbad7641d1afd55a2ec42eeafb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_20_07_25_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方搜查涉案車輛，發現一批懷疑毒品。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f1ae3f1812d7531a2e89a24377388af6/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_20_07_26.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方搜查涉案車輛，發現一批懷疑毒品。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/685dd6461df4bbb3546ab5f6c90ccfb7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_20_07_26_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"司機被捕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8b5af2a7b6b63c04c7d9ad005537c5c3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_20_07_24.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方搜出一批現金。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fab4936ec03d1696cc9c81e27676b3b7/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-02_at_20_07_25.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:21:57.532224+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":273,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T14:08:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T17:38:41.383314+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T14:18:48.078210+00:00","content_hash":"67be76555facd8d3001617ee28f3a5f3264fe28bc649929d06f6f8206efa1cf7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}